  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Executive Suite**\n\nI\'m currently focused on replicating the \"MinuteFlow - Executive Suite\" application, specifically the Dashboard screen. I\'m carefully examining the provided images and design specifications to understand all UI components. I\'m trying to create a faithful implementation of Screen 1.\n\n\n**Defining the Architecture**\n\nI\'ve moved on to designing Screen 2, the New Minute Entry/Editor. I\'m focusing on the breadcrumb navigation and the \"Save Draft\" and \"Publish Minute\" buttons at the top. The form layout with its two columns is next, with focus on the left-hand column design.\n\n\n**Constructing the Editor**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in Screen 2. I\'ve broken down the minute entry form into its components. I\'ve designed the Meeting Details section, the Attendees section with avatar-based contacts, and the Next Session date picker with calendar sync. I am working on the right column now, including the points-treated rich text area, the action items list, and how to represent a simulated or real-time dictation/transcription widget within the UI. I have added formatting tools, action item functionality and the floating audio visualizer.\n\n\n**Designing the Export Functionality**\n\nI\'m now deep into designing Screen 4, the Export & Share modal. I\'m focusing on the different target options: Google Drive with folder and sync indicators, WhatsApp with a realistic live chat bubble preview, and Email with a formal template preview and attachment. I\'m also considering the export options as PDF, Markdown and Text, as well as the \"Copy to Clipboard\" and download functionality.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 475670607
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
