    thinking: "**Analyzing Directory Management**\n\nI\'m currently focused on directory management, specifically how it\'s implemented within the `App.tsx` component. The `\'minuteflow_directories\'` key in `localStorage` stores the `directories` state. I\'m looking at the handlers that I\'ve written for directory creation and updates, namely `handleCreateDirectory` and `handleUpdateDirectory`, and their respective signatures. I\'ll need to figure out how to best integrate these features.\n\n\n**Implementing Directory Updates**\n\nI\'ve been working on the implementation of updating directories. Specifically, when a directory\'s name is updated, I\'ve confirmed I\'ll also need to update the `minute.directory` field for all minutes using the old directory name. I\'m also planning the design details for handling deletion, including how to handle minutes whose directories are deleted. Finally, I\'ve considered how to implement a reset function to default directories if needed. I am about to start working on the UI in LibraryView.tsx!\n\n\n"
