    thinking: "**Examining App.tsx**\n\nI\'m now diving into `App.tsx` and meticulously planning the updates. I\'ve identified the need for `directories` to be managed with persistent `localStorage` using the key `minuteflow_directories`. The core implementation looks like it\'ll use `const [directories, setDirectories]`\n\n\n**Implementing Directory Operations**\n\nI\'ve outlined directory operations within `App.tsx`, including create, update, delete, and reset functionality. Creating uses `handleCreateDirectory`, and so on. Updating a directory affects associated minutes, which seems critical. Deleting moves orphaned minutes. Resetting reverts to initial directory values. Minute operations, such as deleting individual minutes, or groups of minutes, also appear to be well-defined.\n\n\n**Analyzing LibraryView.tsx**\n\nI\'m now focusing on `LibraryView.tsx` to integrate the folder management features. I\'m adding a \"Nueva\" button to the \"Carpetas\" header for folder creation and action icons (pencil for rename, trash for delete) on hover. The top bar will feature \"Opciones de Actas,\" with options to clean, create, and reset sample minutes, as appropriate. I\'ll need to improve the empty state display too.\n\n\n"
